```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Checklist["Post-Rollback Verification (4-Point Checklist)"]
        C1["✅ 1. DNS Port 53 Resolution\n`nslookup google.com 192.168.1.1`\n→ Valid IP in < 20 ms"]
        C2["✅ 2. Pass-Through Ad Test\n`nslookup doubleclick.net 192.168.1.1`\n→ Real Google IP (not 0.0.0.0)"]
        C3["✅ 3. Firewall Table State\n`iptables -t nat -L PREROUTING -n`\n→ No hanging REDIRECT rules"]
        C4["✅ 4. Flash Memory Footprint\n`df -k /userconfig`\n→ > 4 MB free"]
    end
```